  "html": "<article id=\"post-4922\" class=\"container post-4922 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-uncategorized area-of-service-air-purifiers area-of-service-indoor-air-quality area-of-service-air-ducts\">\n<div class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n<a href=\"/about-us/blog\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronleft\" /></svg><span >Blog Posts</span>\n\n</a></div>\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\t\t<h1 class=\"entry-title has-secondary-color mt-3\">Air Filtration Systems: Surviving Allergy Season in Durham</h1>\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-meta\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"posted-on p-sm\">Published on <span><time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2019-10-17T04:00:00+00:00\">October 17, 2019</time><time class=\"updated\" datetime=\"2025-04-12T01:08:14+00:00\">April 12, 2025</time></span></span>\t\t\t</div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n\t\t\t</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"post-thumbnail\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1710\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-changing-an-air-filter-scaled.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"A Happy Home Services technician changing an air filter\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-changing-an-air-filter-scaled.jpg 2560w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-changing-an-air-filter-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-changing-an-air-filter-1024x684.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-changing-an-air-filter-768x513.jpg 768w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-changing-an-air-filter-1536x1026.jpg 1536w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-changing-an-air-filter-2048x1368.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 50vw, 768px\" />\t\t\t</figure><!-- .post-thumbnail -->\n\n\t<div class=\"entry-content | asymmetric-container | mb-5\">\n\t\t<div class=\"asymmetric-main blog--main flow\">\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The allergy season in Durham, NC, is usually in spring and summer when tree pollen, bermuda grass, and ragweed pollen start being released into the air. If you have plant and tree allergies, this time of year can make you absolutely miserable. You may even be having trouble getting away from those unwanted allergens inside your home. With open windows, drafts, and even air being pulled in by the conditioner, these allergens find their way inside. However, you can keep them out with help from Happy Home Heating &amp; Cooling .</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We are a local Durham HVAC company that offers a selection of air filter and purification systems that do much to keep the air inside the home clean. You may think that the simple accordion fold filter in your existing HVAC system is good enough, but it’s not. These filters are designed to keep dust and debris out of the HVAC equipment. They can’t catch microscopic particles like pollen and dust mites.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Air Purification Systems for Allergies</h3>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Keeping allergens out of the air inside your house requires a special filter designed to trap much smaller particles. Among the most common are High Energy Particulate Air (HEPA) filters, which are made from densely packed glass fibers. These popular filters remove up to 99% of dust, smoke, and pollen from the air.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We can help you with the installation of an air purification system with HEPA filters or other technology developed to eliminate allergens, mold spores, and also keep your air smelling fresh and clean. You’ll be surprised at how easily an air filter system fits into your home without construction or extra hassle.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Air Duct Cleaning Services</h3>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Happy Home Heating &amp; Cooling also offers air duct replacement and cleaning, especially if you live in an older home and have never had the ducts worked on. Sometimes, gaps develop between air duct connections that allow outside air to be pulled into the home, which bypasses any filter system . It can also make your HVAC system inefficient, resulting in high energy bills. We’ll seal these gaps and replace the ductwork, as needed, to keep the system airtight. When cleaning out the ductwork, our team uses special equipment to completely remove any built up dust, debris, or even mold that could be causing your family problems.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our team offers a comprehensive range of HVAC services that include much more than just air purification . For more information, you can always give the Happy Home Heating &amp; Cooling representatives a phone call. We can even provide a free in-home inspection of the HVAC system, and price estimate for our air purification systems when you fill out our online quote form.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"asymmetric-side blog--sidebar\">\n\t\t\t<div  class=\"card card--post has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Have a question?\" aria-label=\"Have a question?\">Have a question?</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\"><div class=\"flow\"><p>Let’s connect and have a quick conversation to see how we can help.</p>\n<a href=\"tel:+13362819025\" aria-label=\"Call now: +13362819025\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta phone-link\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phon